###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/neo#referenceINIS
:referenceINIS rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty ;
               rdfs:comment "Reference to the IAEA INIS Thesaurus term  that might provide additional information about the subject resource."@en ,
